        "message": "=Dear {{ $('Google Sheets Trigger').item.json.Customer }},<br><br>We are pleased to inform you that your support ticket has been resolved.<br><br><b>Ticket ID:</b> {{ $('Google Sheets Trigger').item.json['Ticket ID'] }}<br><b>Subject:</b> {{ $('Google Sheets Trigger').item.json.Subject }}<br><b>Original Request:</b> {{ $('Google Sheets Trigger').item.json.Description }}<br><br>If you have any further questions or if the issue persists, please do not hesitate to reach out to us, and we will be happy to assist you further.<br><br>Thank you for your patience and for allowing us the opportunity to resolve this matter.<br><br>Warm regards,<br>Customer Support Team",
        "options": {}
      },
