        "message": "=Dear {{ $('Google Sheets Trigger').item.json.Customer }},<br><br>We hope your recent support experience was a positive one. Your feedback helps us continue to improve the quality of service we provide.<br><br><b>Ticket ID:</b> {{ $('Google Sheets Trigger').item.json['Ticket ID'] }}<br><b>Subject:</b> {{ $('Google Sheets Trigger').item.json.Subject }}<br><br>Could you please take a moment to rate your experience and share any comments? Simply reply to this email with:<br><br>1. A rating from 1 (Poor) to 5 (Excellent)<br>2. Any additional feedback you would like to share<br><br>Thank you for choosing us, and we look forward to hearing from you.<br><br>Warm regards,<br>Customer Support Team",
